    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        195,
        1276,
        1448,
        1495
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A new initiative is the creation of an Internal Audit Committee. The Committee will be comprised of the first Deputy Mayor, the Director of the Mayor's Office of Operations, the Director of the Office of Management and Budget, and the Department of Investigations. This Committee will be responsible for overseeing the various audit and oversight functions outlined above.",
